(725,714,$mw$332D65C215EDB9318ECDCA805073C732F1D151307360476A39061AA3AA8D79A9$mw$,$mw$b1e9ff9dc2938ac772202dd747ad8b90$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":714,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ربط تكامل دالة ثابتة بمساحة منطقة مثلثية","TitleEn":"Interpret the integral of 1 as a triangular area","QuestionTextAr":"احسب التكامل المزدوج للدالة 1 على المنطقة x ≥ 0 وy ≥ 0 وx+y ≤ 1.","QuestionTextEn":"Find the double integral of 1 over the region x ≥ 0, y ≥ 0, x+y ≤ 1.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المنطقة مثلث قائم ساقاه 1 و1، وتكامل 1 يساوي المساحة: (1 × 1)/2 = 1/2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"The region is a right triangle with legs 1 and 1. Integrating 1 gives its area, 1/2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2801,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac14","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2802,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2803,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2804,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ارسم حدود المنطقة على المستوي الإحداثي.","En":"Sketch the region's boundaries on the coordinate plane."},{"Ar":"تكامل الدالة الثابتة واحد يعطي مساحة المنطقة؛ حدّد شكلها الهندسي.","En":"The integral of the constant one gives the region's area; identify its shape."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ربط تكامل دالة ثابتة بمساحة منطقة مثلثية","En":"Interpret the integral of 1 as a triangular area"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac14","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الربع ينتج من تنصيف مساحة المثلث مرة ثانية.","En":"One quarter halves the triangle area twice."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 مساحة المربع المحيط بالمنطقة، لا المثلث.","En":"One is the area of the enclosing square, not the triangle."}},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 أكبر من مساحة المربع الحاوي للمنطقة.","En":"Two exceeds the area of the enclosing square."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب التكامل المزدوج للدالة 1 على المنطقة x ≥ 0 وy ≥ 0 وx+y ≤ 1.","En":"Find the double integral of 1 over the region x ≥ 0, y ≥ 0, x+y ≤ 1."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"خاصية التكامل المساحي: $\\iint_R 1\\,dA=\\operatorname{Area}(R)$، ومساحة المثلث $bh/2$.","En":"Area integral identity: $\\iint_R 1\\,dA=\\operatorname{Area}(R)$; triangle area is $bh/2$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدود المنطقة هي المحوران والمستقيم x+y=1؛ رؤوسها (0,0)، (1,0)، (0,1).","En":"The axes and line x+y=1 bound a triangle with vertices (0,0), (1,0), (0,1)."},{"Ar":"نثبت x بين 0 و1؛ يتغير y بين 0 و1−x. فينتج التكامل الداخلي $1-x$.","En":"Fix x between zero and one; y varies from zero to 1−x. The inner integral gives $1-x$."},{"Ar":"نكامل $1-x$ بين 0 و1 فنحصل على النصف.","En":"Integrate $1-x$ from zero to one to obtain one half."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac12$","En":"$\\frac12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستبدل الحد المائل بحد ثابت فيصير المثلث مربعاً.","En":"Do not replace the sloping boundary with a constant and turn the triangle into a square."},"FormulaLatex":"\\iint_R1\\,dA=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-x}1\\,dy\\,dx","Substitution":{"Ar":"$[x-x^2/2]_0^1=1/2$","En":"$[x-x^2/2]_0^1=1/2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\operatorname{Area}(R)=1\\cdot1/2=1/2$","En":"$\\operatorname{Area}(R)=1\\cdot1/2=1/2$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":58,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ارسم حدود المنطقة على المستوي الإحداثي.","En":"Sketch the region's boundaries on the coordinate plane."},{"Ar":"تكامل الدالة الثابتة واحد يعطي مساحة المنطقة؛ حدّد شكلها الهندسي.","En":"The integral of the constant one gives the region's area; identify its shape."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"خاصية التكامل المساحي: $\\iint_R 1\\,dA=\\operatorname{Area}(R)$، ومساحة المثلث $bh/2$.","En":"Area integral identity: $\\iint_R 1\\,dA=\\operatorname{Area}(R)$; triangle area is $bh/2$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدود المنطقة هي المحوران والمستقيم x+y=1؛ رؤوسها (0,0)، (1,0)، (0,1).","En":"The axes and line x+y=1 bound a triangle with vertices (0,0), (1,0), (0,1)."},{"Ar":"نثبت x بين 0 و1؛ يتغير y بين 0 و1−x. فينتج التكامل الداخلي $1-x$.","En":"Fix x between zero and one; y varies from zero to 1−x. The inner integral gives $1-x$."},{"Ar":"نكامل $1-x$ بين 0 و1 فنحصل على النصف.","En":"Integrate $1-x$ from zero to one to obtain one half."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac12$","En":"$\\frac12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستبدل الحد المائل بحد ثابت فيصير المثلث مربعاً.","En":"Do not replace the sloping boundary with a constant and turn the triangle into a square."},"FormulaLatex":"\\iint_R1\\,dA=\\int_0^1\\int_0^{1-x}1\\,dy\\,dx","Substitution":{"Ar":"$[x-x^2/2]_0^1=1/2$","En":"$[x-x^2/2]_0^1=1/2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\operatorname{Area}(R)=1\\cdot1/2=1/2$","En":"$\\operatorname{Area}(R)=1\\cdot1/2=1/2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الربع ينتج من تنصيف مساحة المثلث مرة ثانية.","En":"One quarter halves the triangle area twice."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 مساحة المربع المحيط بالمنطقة، لا المثلث.","En":"One is the area of the enclosing square, not the triangle."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 أكبر من مساحة المربع الحاوي للمنطقة.","En":"Two exceeds the area of the enclosing square."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$خاصية التكامل المساحي: $\iint_R 1\,dA=\operatorname{Area}(R)$، ومساحة المثلث $bh/2$.

$\iint_R1\,dA=\int_0^1\int_0^{1-x}1\,dy\,dx$

1. حدود المنطقة هي المحوران والمستقيم x+y=1؛ رؤوسها (0,0)، (1,0)، (0,1).

2. نثبت x بين 0 و1؛ يتغير y بين 0 و1−x. فينتج التكامل الداخلي $1-x$.

3. نكامل $1-x$ بين 0 و1 فنحصل على النصف.

$[x-x^2/2]_0^1=1/2$

$\frac12$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\operatorname{Area}(R)=1\cdot1/2=1/2$

لا تستبدل الحد المائل بحد ثابت فيصير المثلث مربعاً.$mw$,$mw$Area integral identity: $\iint_R 1\,dA=\operatorname{Area}(R)$; triangle area is $bh/2$.

$\iint_R1\,dA=\int_0^1\int_0^{1-x}1\,dy\,dx$

1. The axes and line x+y=1 bound a triangle with vertices (0,0), (1,0), (0,1).

2. Fix x between zero and one; y varies from zero to 1−x. The inner integral gives $1-x$.

3. Integrate $1-x$ from zero to one to obtain one half.

$[x-x^2/2]_0^1=1/2$

$\frac12$ Dimensionless

$\operatorname{Area}(R)=1\cdot1/2=1/2$

Do not replace the sloping boundary with a constant and turn the triangle into a square.$mw$),
(726,715,$mw$87CAE2FC8A009D58AFA2FE7D55F63C2D013343FE3535AC70CFAFE03698F25C11$mw$,$mw$8f3faaa1df355ed788d05dc41c42a028$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":715,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب تكامل مزدوج لدالة تعتمد على متغير واحد","TitleEn":"Integrate a single-variable function over a rectangle","QuestionTextAr":"احسب التكامل المزدوج لـ x² على المنطقة 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 و0 ≤ y ≤ 2.","QuestionTextEn":"Calculate the double integral of x² over the region 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 and 0 ≤ y ≤ 2.","DetailedSolutionAr":"التكامل بالنسبة إلى y يعطي 2x²، ثم تكامل 2x² من 0 إلى 1 هو 2/3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Integrating with respect to y yields 2x². Integrating from x=0 to 1 gives 2/3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2805,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2806,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2807,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac23","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2808,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"المنطقة مستطيلة والدالة لا تعتمد على المتغير الثاني.","En":"The region is rectangular and the integrand does not depend on the second variable."},{"Ar":"كامل بالنسبة إلى المتغير الثاني أولاً ثم طبّق قاعدة القوى على التكامل المتبقي.","En":"Integrate with respect to the second variable first, then apply the power rule."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب تكامل مزدوج لدالة تعتمد على متغير واحد","En":"Integrate a single-variable function over a rectangle"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac13","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/3 تكامل x² وحده دون عرض المنطقة في اتجاه y.","En":"One third integrates x² alone without the y-width."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/2 ليس ناتج قاعدة القوة؛ الأس يزيد إلى 3.","En":"One half is not the power-rule result; the exponent increases to three."}},{"LatexCode":"\\frac23","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 مساحة المستطيل لا تكامل x² عليه.","En":"Two is the rectangle area, not the integral of x²."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب التكامل المزدوج لـ x² على المنطقة 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 و0 ≤ y ≤ 2.","En":"Calculate the double integral of x² over the region 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 and 0 ≤ y ≤ 2."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قانون التكامل المتكرر على مستطيل: $\\int_0^1\\int_0^2 x^2\\,dy\\,dx$، مع قاعدة القوة $\\int x^2dx=x^3/3+C$.","En":"Iterated integral on the rectangle: $\\int_0^1\\int_0^2 x^2\\,dy\\,dx$, using $\\int x^2dx=x^3/3+C$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الدالة مستمرة على المستطيل، فيجوز استخدام التكامل المتكرر.","En":"The function is continuous on the rectangle, so iterated integration applies."},{"Ar":"بما أن x² ثابت بالنسبة إلى y، فإن $\\int_0^2x^2dy=2x^2$.","En":"Since x² is constant in y, $\\int_0^2x^2dy=2x^2$."},{"Ar":"نكامل بالنسبة إلى x فنحصل على $[2x^3/3]_0^1=2/3$.","En":"Integrate in x to obtain $[2x^3/3]_0^1=2/3$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac23$","En":"$\\frac23$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تسقط عامل طول الفترة في المتغير الذي لا تظهره الدالة.","En":"Do not drop the interval length for the variable absent from the integrand."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_0^1\\int_0^2x^2\\,dy\\,dx","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx=2/3$","En":"$2\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx=2/3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\int_0^2\\left(\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx\\right)dy=2/3$","En":"$\\int_0^2\\left(\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx\\right)dy=2/3$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":58,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"المنطقة مستطيلة والدالة لا تعتمد على المتغير الثاني.","En":"The region is rectangular and the integrand does not depend on the second variable."},{"Ar":"كامل بالنسبة إلى المتغير الثاني أولاً ثم طبّق قاعدة القوى على التكامل المتبقي.","En":"Integrate with respect to the second variable first, then apply the power rule."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قانون التكامل المتكرر على مستطيل: $\\int_0^1\\int_0^2 x^2\\,dy\\,dx$، مع قاعدة القوة $\\int x^2dx=x^3/3+C$.","En":"Iterated integral on the rectangle: $\\int_0^1\\int_0^2 x^2\\,dy\\,dx$, using $\\int x^2dx=x^3/3+C$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الدالة مستمرة على المستطيل، فيجوز استخدام التكامل المتكرر.","En":"The function is continuous on the rectangle, so iterated integration applies."},{"Ar":"بما أن x² ثابت بالنسبة إلى y، فإن $\\int_0^2x^2dy=2x^2$.","En":"Since x² is constant in y, $\\int_0^2x^2dy=2x^2$."},{"Ar":"نكامل بالنسبة إلى x فنحصل على $[2x^3/3]_0^1=2/3$.","En":"Integrate in x to obtain $[2x^3/3]_0^1=2/3$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac23$","En":"$\\frac23$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تسقط عامل طول الفترة في المتغير الذي لا تظهره الدالة.","En":"Do not drop the interval length for the variable absent from the integrand."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_0^1\\int_0^2x^2\\,dy\\,dx","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx=2/3$","En":"$2\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx=2/3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\int_0^2\\left(\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx\\right)dy=2/3$","En":"$\\int_0^2\\left(\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx\\right)dy=2/3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/3 تكامل x² وحده دون عرض المنطقة في اتجاه y.","En":"One third integrates x² alone without the y-width."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/2 ليس ناتج قاعدة القوة؛ الأس يزيد إلى 3.","En":"One half is not the power-rule result; the exponent increases to three."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 مساحة المستطيل لا تكامل x² عليه.","En":"Two is the rectangle area, not the integral of x²."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قانون التكامل المتكرر على مستطيل: $\int_0^1\int_0^2 x^2\,dy\,dx$، مع قاعدة القوة $\int x^2dx=x^3/3+C$.

$\int_0^1\int_0^2x^2\,dy\,dx$

1. الدالة مستمرة على المستطيل، فيجوز استخدام التكامل المتكرر.

2. بما أن x² ثابت بالنسبة إلى y، فإن $\int_0^2x^2dy=2x^2$.

3. نكامل بالنسبة إلى x فنحصل على $[2x^3/3]_0^1=2/3$.

$2\int_0^1x^2\,dx=2/3$

$\frac23$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\int_0^2\left(\int_0^1x^2\,dx\right)dy=2/3$

لا تسقط عامل طول الفترة في المتغير الذي لا تظهره الدالة.$mw$,$mw$Iterated integral on the rectangle: $\int_0^1\int_0^2 x^2\,dy\,dx$, using $\int x^2dx=x^3/3+C$.

$\int_0^1\int_0^2x^2\,dy\,dx$

1. The function is continuous on the rectangle, so iterated integration applies.

2. Since x² is constant in y, $\int_0^2x^2dy=2x^2$.

3. Integrate in x to obtain $[2x^3/3]_0^1=2/3$.

$2\int_0^1x^2\,dx=2/3$

$\frac23$ Dimensionless

$\int_0^2\left(\int_0^1x^2\,dx\right)dy=2/3$

Do not drop the interval length for the variable absent from the integrand.$mw$),
(727,716,$mw$669904104FEF8301E82735B27BECDD1F7A7571CB9C5CF9F73D52F2231E2CE5CE$mw$,$mw$79dd988a8d2828af81a9c40a4a75ab47$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":716,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"توظيف التناظر لحساب تكامل مزدوج","TitleEn":"Exploit symmetry of an integrand over a square","QuestionTextAr":"ما قيمة التكامل المزدوج لـ (x−y) على المربع 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 و0 ≤ y ≤ 1؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the double integral of (x−y) over the square 0 ≤ x ≤ 1, 0 ≤ y ≤ 1?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المنطقة متناظرة عند تبادل x وy، والدالة تتغير إشارتها؛ لذا التكامل صفر. وبالحساب: 1/2 − 1/2 = 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Swapping x and y leaves the square unchanged but reverses the integrand's sign, so the integral is zero. Directly: 1/2 − 1/2 = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2853,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2854,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2855,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2856,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ تناظر حدود المربع.","En":"Notice the symmetric square bounds."},{"Ar":"كامل الحدين منفصلين أو استعمل التناظر.","En":"Integrate the two terms separately or use symmetry."}],"Title":{"Ar":"توظيف التناظر لحساب تكامل مزدوج","En":"Exploit symmetry of an integrand over a square"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"تكامل x موجب ويساوي نصفاً، فلا يكون الفرق −1.","En":"The integral of x is positive one half, so the difference is not −1."}},{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"النصف مساهمة x وحده؛ يجب طرح مساهمة y المساوية.","En":"One half is the x contribution alone; subtract the equal y contribution."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"التكامل الموقّع ليس مساحة المربع.","En":"The signed integral is not the square's area."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما قيمة التكامل المزدوج لـ (x−y) على المربع 0 ≤ x ≤ 1 و0 ≤ y ≤ 1؟","En":"What is the double integral of (x−y) over the square 0 ≤ x ≤ 1, 0 ≤ y ≤ 1?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"على مربع متناظر بتبديل الإحداثيين يتساوى تكامل x مع تكامل y.","En":"On a square symmetric under swapping coordinates, integrals of x and y are equal."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الدالة مستمرة على المربع؛ نفصل التكامل إلى فرق تكاملين.","En":"The function is continuous on the square; split the integral into a difference."},{"Ar":"$\\iint_R x\\,dA=1/2$ و$\\iint_R y\\,dA=1/2$.","En":"$\\iint_R x\\,dA=1/2$ and $\\iint_R y\\,dA=1/2$."},{"Ar":"نطرح المساهمتين المتساويتين فنحصل على صفر.","En":"Subtract the equal contributions to get zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تأخذ القيمة المطلقة للمتكامل؛ المطلوب تكامل موقّع.","En":"Do not take the integrand's absolute value; the signed integral is requested."},"FormulaLatex":"\\iint_R(x-y)\\,dA=\\iint_Rx\\,dA-\\iint_Ry\\,dA","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1/2-1/2=0$","En":"$1/2-1/2=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\int_0^1(x-1/2)\\,dx=0$","En":"$\\int_0^1(x-1/2)\\,dx=0$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":58,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ تناظر حدود المربع.","En":"Notice the symmetric square bounds."},{"Ar":"كامل الحدين منفصلين أو استعمل التناظر.","En":"Integrate the two terms separately or use symmetry."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"على مربع متناظر بتبديل الإحداثيين يتساوى تكامل x مع تكامل y.","En":"On a square symmetric under swapping coordinates, integrals of x and y are equal."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الدالة مستمرة على المربع؛ نفصل التكامل إلى فرق تكاملين.","En":"The function is continuous on the square; split the integral into a difference."},{"Ar":"$\\iint_R x\\,dA=1/2$ و$\\iint_R y\\,dA=1/2$.","En":"$\\iint_R x\\,dA=1/2$ and $\\iint_R y\\,dA=1/2$."},{"Ar":"نطرح المساهمتين المتساويتين فنحصل على صفر.","En":"Subtract the equal contributions to get zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تأخذ القيمة المطلقة للمتكامل؛ المطلوب تكامل موقّع.","En":"Do not take the integrand's absolute value; the signed integral is requested."},"FormulaLatex":"\\iint_R(x-y)\\,dA=\\iint_Rx\\,dA-\\iint_Ry\\,dA","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1/2-1/2=0$","En":"$1/2-1/2=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\int_0^1(x-1/2)\\,dx=0$","En":"$\\int_0^1(x-1/2)\\,dx=0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"تكامل x موجب ويساوي نصفاً، فلا يكون الفرق −1.","En":"The integral of x is positive one half, so the difference is not −1."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"النصف مساهمة x وحده؛ يجب طرح مساهمة y المساوية.","En":"One half is the x contribution alone; subtract the equal y contribution."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"التكامل الموقّع ليس مساحة المربع.","En":"The signed integral is not the square's area."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$على مربع متناظر بتبديل الإحداثيين يتساوى تكامل x مع تكامل y.

$\iint_R(x-y)\,dA=\iint_Rx\,dA-\iint_Ry\,dA$

1. الدالة مستمرة على المربع؛ نفصل التكامل إلى فرق تكاملين.

2. $\iint_R x\,dA=1/2$ و$\iint_R y\,dA=1/2$.

3. نطرح المساهمتين المتساويتين فنحصل على صفر.

$1/2-1/2=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\int_0^1(x-1/2)\,dx=0$

لا تأخذ القيمة المطلقة للمتكامل؛ المطلوب تكامل موقّع.$mw$,$mw$On a square symmetric under swapping coordinates, integrals of x and y are equal.

$\iint_R(x-y)\,dA=\iint_Rx\,dA-\iint_Ry\,dA$

1. The function is continuous on the square; split the integral into a difference.

2. $\iint_R x\,dA=1/2$ and $\iint_R y\,dA=1/2$.

3. Subtract the equal contributions to get zero.

$1/2-1/2=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

$\int_0^1(x-1/2)\,dx=0$

Do not take the integrand's absolute value; the signed integral is requested.$mw$),
(728,717,$mw$F38934B55F4BF80F7E357E2DE30CCECE0B988DD6FE8871ECFE6364D24E2EAD91$mw$,$mw$77449533855bde53cb3060ee1be1f249$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":717,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":16,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخدام النهاية المثلثية الأساسية","TitleEn":"Use the standard sine limit","QuestionTextAr":"احسب النهاية عندما x يقترب من 0 للتعبير sin(3x)/x، مع قياس الزوايا بالراديان.","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate lim as x → 0 of sin(3x)/x, with angles measured in radians.","DetailedSolutionAr":"نعيد الكتابة 3 × [sin(3x)/(3x)]، ونستخدم النهاية الأساسية sin(u)/u → 1؛ إذن النهاية 3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rewrite as 3[sin(3x)/(3x)] and apply lim sin u/u = 1 as u→0, giving 3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2857,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2858,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2859,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2860,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"تذكّر النهاية الأساسية لنسبة الجيب إلى زاويته بالراديان.","En":"Recall the fundamental sine-over-angle limit in radians."},{"Ar":"اضرب واقسم بالمعامل داخل الجيب حتى يظهر التعبير القياسي.","En":"Multiply and divide by the coefficient inside the sine to obtain the standard form."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخدام النهاية المثلثية الأساسية","En":"Use the standard sine limit"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"البسط والمقام يقتربان من الصفر؛ هذا لا يعني أن النسبة صفر.","En":"Both numerator and denominator tend to zero; that does not make the quotient zero."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 نهاية sin(u)/u، لكن هنا يوجد عامل 3.","En":"One is the standard sine ratio limit, but a factor three remains."}},{"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"المعامل داخل الجيب 3 وليس 6.","En":"The coefficient inside the sine is three, not six."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب النهاية عندما x يقترب من 0 للتعبير sin(3x)/x، مع قياس الزوايا بالراديان.","En":"Evaluate lim as x → 0 of sin(3x)/x, with angles measured in radians."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النهاية المثلثية الأساسية بالراديان: $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\sin(u)/u=1$. نعوّض $u=3x$.","En":"Fundamental trigonometric limit in radians: $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\sin(u)/u=1$. Substitute $u=3x$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"لـ x غير صفري نكتب $\\sin(3x)/x=3\\sin(3x)/(3x)$.","En":"For nonzero x rewrite $\\sin(3x)/x=3\\sin(3x)/(3x)$."},{"Ar":"عندما x يقترب من الصفر يقترب 3x أيضاً من الصفر.","En":"As x tends to zero, so does 3x."},{"Ar":"نستخدم النهاية الأساسية للجيب بالراديان فتساوي النسبة الداخلية 1.","En":"Use the standard radian sine limit; the inner ratio tends to one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض بالصفر مباشرة في كسر غير معرف عند الصفر.","En":"Do not directly substitute zero into a quotient undefined there."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{\\sin u}{u}=1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}3\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{3x}=3$","En":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}3\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{3x}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(3x)\\right|_{x=0}=3$","En":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(3x)\\right|_{x=0}=3$"}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":16,"PrimarySkillId":70,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"تذكّر النهاية الأساسية لنسبة الجيب إلى زاويته بالراديان.","En":"Recall the fundamental sine-over-angle limit in radians."},{"Ar":"اضرب واقسم بالمعامل داخل الجيب حتى يظهر التعبير القياسي.","En":"Multiply and divide by the coefficient inside the sine to obtain the standard form."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النهاية المثلثية الأساسية بالراديان: $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\sin(u)/u=1$. نعوّض $u=3x$.","En":"Fundamental trigonometric limit in radians: $\\lim_{u\\to0}\\sin(u)/u=1$. Substitute $u=3x$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"لـ x غير صفري نكتب $\\sin(3x)/x=3\\sin(3x)/(3x)$.","En":"For nonzero x rewrite $\\sin(3x)/x=3\\sin(3x)/(3x)$."},{"Ar":"عندما x يقترب من الصفر يقترب 3x أيضاً من الصفر.","En":"As x tends to zero, so does 3x."},{"Ar":"نستخدم النهاية الأساسية للجيب بالراديان فتساوي النسبة الداخلية 1.","En":"Use the standard radian sine limit; the inner ratio tends to one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض بالصفر مباشرة في كسر غير معرف عند الصفر.","En":"Do not directly substitute zero into a quotient undefined there."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{\\sin u}{u}=1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}3\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{3x}=3$","En":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}3\\frac{\\sin(3x)}{3x}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(3x)\\right|_{x=0}=3$","En":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}\\sin(3x)\\right|_{x=0}=3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"البسط والمقام يقتربان من الصفر؛ هذا لا يعني أن النسبة صفر.","En":"Both numerator and denominator tend to zero; that does not make the quotient zero."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 نهاية sin(u)/u، لكن هنا يوجد عامل 3.","En":"One is the standard sine ratio limit, but a factor three remains."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"المعامل داخل الجيب 3 وليس 6.","En":"The coefficient inside the sine is three, not six."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$النهاية المثلثية الأساسية بالراديان: $\lim_{u\to0}\sin(u)/u=1$. نعوّض $u=3x$.

$\lim_{u\to0}\frac{\sin u}{u}=1$

1. لـ x غير صفري نكتب $\sin(3x)/x=3\sin(3x)/(3x)$.

2. عندما x يقترب من الصفر يقترب 3x أيضاً من الصفر.

3. نستخدم النهاية الأساسية للجيب بالراديان فتساوي النسبة الداخلية 1.

$\lim_{x\to0}3\frac{\sin(3x)}{3x}=3$

$3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\left.\frac{d}{dx}\sin(3x)\right|_{x=0}=3$

لا تعوض بالصفر مباشرة في كسر غير معرف عند الصفر.$mw$,$mw$Fundamental trigonometric limit in radians: $\lim_{u\to0}\sin(u)/u=1$. Substitute $u=3x$.

$\lim_{u\to0}\frac{\sin u}{u}=1$

1. For nonzero x rewrite $\sin(3x)/x=3\sin(3x)/(3x)$.

2. As x tends to zero, so does 3x.

3. Use the standard radian sine limit; the inner ratio tends to one.

$\lim_{x\to0}3\frac{\sin(3x)}{3x}=3$

$3$ Dimensionless

$\left.\frac{d}{dx}\sin(3x)\right|_{x=0}=3$

Do not directly substitute zero into a quotient undefined there.$mw$),
(729,718,$mw$1F0729642165A057FFC577124E5B9F0EC906A3E1C96E8EE14800FE1338F05A7A$mw$,$mw$cd863cad8893ab721591f499740d14c1$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":718,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":16,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تقييم نهاية باستخدام هوية مثلثية","TitleEn":"Evaluate a limit using a trigonometric identity","QuestionTextAr":"ما نهاية (1−cos x)/x عندما x → 0 بالراديان؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is lim (1−cos x)/x as x → 0 in radians?","DetailedSolutionAr":"باستخدام 1−cos x = 2sin²(x/2) أو التوسع المحلي، يكون البسط من رتبة x²، لذا النسبة تقترب من 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Using 1−cos x = 2sin²(x/2), the numerator is order x² near zero, so the quotient tends to 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2861,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2862,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2863,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2864,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حلل البسط بمتطابقة نصف الزاوية.","En":"Rewrite the numerator with the half-angle identity."},{"Ar":"افصل عامل جيب يقترب من صفر وعامل نسبة الجيب إلى الزاوية.","En":"Separate a sine factor tending to zero and a sine-to-angle ratio."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تقييم نهاية باستخدام هوية مثلثية","En":"Evaluate a limit using a trigonometric identity"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"نهاية التعبير من الجهتين صفر وليست −1.","En":"The two-sided limit is zero, not −1."}},{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"النصف يظهر في نهاية (1−cos x)/x²، لا في المسألة المعطاة.","En":"One half occurs with denominator x², not the given x."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"نهاية الجيب على زاويته 1، لكن هنا عامل إضافي يقترب من صفر.","En":"Sine over its angle tends to one, but another factor tends to zero here."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما نهاية (1−cos x)/x عندما x → 0 بالراديان؟","En":"What is lim (1−cos x)/x as x → 0 in radians?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعمل متطابقة نصف الزاوية ونهاية الجيب الأساسية بالراديان.","En":"Use the half-angle identity and the fundamental sine limit in radians."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نستخدم $1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2(x/2)$.","En":"Use $1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2(x/2)$."},{"Ar":"لـ x غير صفري يصبح الكسر $\\sin(x/2)\\,\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}$.","En":"For nonzero x the quotient becomes $\\sin(x/2)\\,\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}$."},{"Ar":"العامل الأول يؤول إلى صفر والثاني إلى واحد بالراديان.","En":"The first factor tends to zero and the second to one in radians."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المقام x مع x².","En":"Do not confuse denominator x with x²."},"FormulaLatex":"1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2(x/2)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\sin(x/2)\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}=0$","En":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\sin(x/2)\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}(1-\\cos x)\\right|_{x=0}=\\sin0=0$","En":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}(1-\\cos x)\\right|_{x=0}=\\sin0=0$"}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":16,"PrimarySkillId":70,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حلل البسط بمتطابقة نصف الزاوية.","En":"Rewrite the numerator with the half-angle identity."},{"Ar":"افصل عامل جيب يقترب من صفر وعامل نسبة الجيب إلى الزاوية.","En":"Separate a sine factor tending to zero and a sine-to-angle ratio."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعمل متطابقة نصف الزاوية ونهاية الجيب الأساسية بالراديان.","En":"Use the half-angle identity and the fundamental sine limit in radians."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نستخدم $1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2(x/2)$.","En":"Use $1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2(x/2)$."},{"Ar":"لـ x غير صفري يصبح الكسر $\\sin(x/2)\\,\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}$.","En":"For nonzero x the quotient becomes $\\sin(x/2)\\,\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}$."},{"Ar":"العامل الأول يؤول إلى صفر والثاني إلى واحد بالراديان.","En":"The first factor tends to zero and the second to one in radians."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المقام x مع x².","En":"Do not confuse denominator x with x²."},"FormulaLatex":"1-\\cos x=2\\sin^2(x/2)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\sin(x/2)\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}=0$","En":"$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\sin(x/2)\\frac{\\sin(x/2)}{x/2}=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}(1-\\cos x)\\right|_{x=0}=\\sin0=0$","En":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}(1-\\cos x)\\right|_{x=0}=\\sin0=0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"نهاية التعبير من الجهتين صفر وليست −1.","En":"The two-sided limit is zero, not −1."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"النصف يظهر في نهاية (1−cos x)/x²، لا في المسألة المعطاة.","En":"One half occurs with denominator x², not the given x."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"نهاية الجيب على زاويته 1، لكن هنا عامل إضافي يقترب من صفر.","En":"Sine over its angle tends to one, but another factor tends to zero here."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستعمل متطابقة نصف الزاوية ونهاية الجيب الأساسية بالراديان.

$1-\cos x=2\sin^2(x/2)$

1. نستخدم $1-\cos x=2\sin^2(x/2)$.

2. لـ x غير صفري يصبح الكسر $\sin(x/2)\,\frac{\sin(x/2)}{x/2}$.

3. العامل الأول يؤول إلى صفر والثاني إلى واحد بالراديان.

$\lim_{x\to0}\sin(x/2)\frac{\sin(x/2)}{x/2}=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\left.\frac{d}{dx}(1-\cos x)\right|_{x=0}=\sin0=0$

لا تخلط المقام x مع x².$mw$,$mw$Use the half-angle identity and the fundamental sine limit in radians.

$1-\cos x=2\sin^2(x/2)$

1. Use $1-\cos x=2\sin^2(x/2)$.

2. For nonzero x the quotient becomes $\sin(x/2)\,\frac{\sin(x/2)}{x/2}$.

3. The first factor tends to zero and the second to one in radians.

$\lim_{x\to0}\sin(x/2)\frac{\sin(x/2)}{x/2}=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

$\left.\frac{d}{dx}(1-\cos x)\right|_{x=0}=\sin0=0$

Do not confuse denominator x with x².$mw$),
(730,719,$mw$9CD37FC574DD2667EA3BCCAF378EB34779817352E64A4D67B8A6F8B1A15315F8$mw$,$mw$300276889a2a63be147827aab0e25231$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":719,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":16,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب نهاية دالة نسبية عند اللانهاية","TitleEn":"Find a rational function's limit at infinity","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد نهاية (2x²+1)/(x²−3) عندما x → +∞.","QuestionTextEn":"Find the limit of (2x²+1)/(x²−3) as x → +∞.","DetailedSolutionAr":"نقسم البسط والمقام على x² لنحصل على (2+1/x²)/(1−3/x²). عندما x يذهب إلى اللانهاية تصبح النسبة 2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Divide numerator and denominator by x²: (2+1/x²)/(1−3/x²). The vanishing terms leave 2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2865,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2866,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2867,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2868,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\infty","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن أعلى درجتين.","En":"Compare the highest powers."},{"Ar":"اقسم البسط والمقام على أعلى قوة ثم احسب النهاية.","En":"Divide numerator and denominator by the highest power, then take the limit."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب نهاية دالة نسبية عند اللانهاية","En":"Find a rational function's limit at infinity"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"البسط والمقام لهما الدرجة نفسها، فلا يزول الحد الرئيس.","En":"Numerator and denominator have equal degree, so the leading ratio does not vanish."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل البسط الرئيس 2 لا 1.","En":"The leading numerator coefficient is two, not one."}},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\infty","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدرجتان متساويتان، لذلك لا تنمو النسبة بلا حد.","En":"The degrees are equal, so the ratio does not grow unbounded."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد نهاية (2x²+1)/(x²−3) عندما x → +∞.","En":"Find the limit of (2x²+1)/(x²−3) as x → +∞."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند تساوي درجتي البسط والمقام تكون النهاية نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين.","En":"Equal numerator and denominator degrees give the ratio of leading coefficients."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عند x كبير موجب يكون المقام غير صفري، فنقسم البسط والمقام على x².","En":"For sufficiently large positive x the denominator is nonzero; divide top and bottom by x²."},{"Ar":"تصبح النسبة $(2+1/x^2)/(1-3/x^2)$.","En":"The quotient becomes $(2+1/x^2)/(1-3/x^2)$."},{"Ar":"الحدود التي تحتوي 1/x² تؤول إلى الصفر؛ المقام يؤول إلى 1.","En":"Terms containing 1/x² vanish; the denominator tends to one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقارن قيم الثوابت فقط؛ استخدم أعلى قوة.","En":"Do not compare constants alone; use the highest power."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}=\\frac{2+1/x^2}{1-3/x^2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2+0}{1-0}=2$","En":"$\\frac{2+0}{1-0}=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}-2=\\frac7{x^2-3}\\to0$","En":"$\\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}-2=\\frac7{x^2-3}\\to0$"}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":16,"PrimarySkillId":70,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن أعلى درجتين.","En":"Compare the highest powers."},{"Ar":"اقسم البسط والمقام على أعلى قوة ثم احسب النهاية.","En":"Divide numerator and denominator by the highest power, then take the limit."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند تساوي درجتي البسط والمقام تكون النهاية نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين.","En":"Equal numerator and denominator degrees give the ratio of leading coefficients."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عند x كبير موجب يكون المقام غير صفري، فنقسم البسط والمقام على x².","En":"For sufficiently large positive x the denominator is nonzero; divide top and bottom by x²."},{"Ar":"تصبح النسبة $(2+1/x^2)/(1-3/x^2)$.","En":"The quotient becomes $(2+1/x^2)/(1-3/x^2)$."},{"Ar":"الحدود التي تحتوي 1/x² تؤول إلى الصفر؛ المقام يؤول إلى 1.","En":"Terms containing 1/x² vanish; the denominator tends to one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقارن قيم الثوابت فقط؛ استخدم أعلى قوة.","En":"Do not compare constants alone; use the highest power."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}=\\frac{2+1/x^2}{1-3/x^2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2+0}{1-0}=2$","En":"$\\frac{2+0}{1-0}=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}-2=\\frac7{x^2-3}\\to0$","En":"$\\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}-2=\\frac7{x^2-3}\\to0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"البسط والمقام لهما الدرجة نفسها، فلا يزول الحد الرئيس.","En":"Numerator and denominator have equal degree, so the leading ratio does not vanish."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل البسط الرئيس 2 لا 1.","En":"The leading numerator coefficient is two, not one."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدرجتان متساويتان، لذلك لا تنمو النسبة بلا حد.","En":"The degrees are equal, so the ratio does not grow unbounded."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$عند تساوي درجتي البسط والمقام تكون النهاية نسبة المعاملين الرئيسيين.

$\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}=\frac{2+1/x^2}{1-3/x^2}$

1. عند x كبير موجب يكون المقام غير صفري، فنقسم البسط والمقام على x².

2. تصبح النسبة $(2+1/x^2)/(1-3/x^2)$.

3. الحدود التي تحتوي 1/x² تؤول إلى الصفر؛ المقام يؤول إلى 1.

$\frac{2+0}{1-0}=2$

$2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}-2=\frac7{x^2-3}\to0$

لا تقارن قيم الثوابت فقط؛ استخدم أعلى قوة.$mw$,$mw$Equal numerator and denominator degrees give the ratio of leading coefficients.

$\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}=\frac{2+1/x^2}{1-3/x^2}$

1. For sufficiently large positive x the denominator is nonzero; divide top and bottom by x².

2. The quotient becomes $(2+1/x^2)/(1-3/x^2)$.

3. Terms containing 1/x² vanish; the denominator tends to one.

$\frac{2+0}{1-0}=2$

$2$ Dimensionless

$\frac{2x^2+1}{x^2-3}-2=\frac7{x^2-3}\to0$

Do not compare constants alone; use the highest power.$mw$),
(731,720,$mw$EA25ECF2A7A55F4D1F8BA1DC1862280516126504E804AF8FC150E96501267955$mw$,$mw$a48da48d5a0443806a2946f5af2c6862$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":720,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":16,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخدام النهاية الأساسية للدالة الأسية","TitleEn":"Use the exponential derivative limit","QuestionTextAr":"احسب نهاية (e^(2x)−1)/x عندما x → 0.","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate lim (e^(2x)−1)/x as x → 0.","DetailedSolutionAr":"نكتب 2 × [(e^(2x)−1)/(2x)]، والنهاية الأساسية (e^u−1)/u تساوي 1؛ لذلك النتيجة 2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Write 2[(e^(2x)−1)/(2x)] and use lim (e^u−1)/u = 1. The result is 2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2869,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2870,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2871,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2872,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"e^2","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن صيغة النهاية الأسية الأساسية.","En":"Look for the fundamental exponential limit form."},{"Ar":"أعد كتابة الكسر بحيث يكون المقام مساوياً للأس الموجود في البسط مع إخراج المعامل المناسب.","En":"Rewrite so the denominator matches the exponent, accounting for the outside coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخدام النهاية الأساسية للدالة الأسية","En":"Use the exponential derivative limit"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"صفر البسط لا يعني نهاية صفر لأن المقام يقترب من صفر أيضاً.","En":"A vanishing numerator does not imply a zero limit when the denominator also vanishes."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 النهاية القياسية عند مقام 2x؛ نحتاج العامل 2.","En":"One is the standard limit with denominator 2x; a factor two remains."}},{"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"e^2","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"e² قيمة الدالة عند x=1 لا نهاية خارج القسمة عند صفر.","En":"e² is the exponential value at x=1, not the quotient limit at zero."}}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب نهاية (e^(2x)−1)/x عندما x → 0.","En":"Evaluate lim (e^(2x)−1)/x as x → 0."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النهاية الأسية الأساسية: $\\lim_{u\\to0}(e^u-1)/u=1$. نعوض $u=2x$.","En":"Fundamental exponential limit: $\\lim_{u\\to0}(e^u-1)/u=1$. Substitute $u=2x$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضع $u=2x$، فيؤول u إلى الصفر.","En":"Set $u=2x$, which tends to zero."},{"Ar":"نعيد كتابة الكسر $2(e^u-1)/u$.","En":"Rewrite the quotient as $2(e^u-1)/u$."},{"Ar":"نهاية النسبة الأسية القياسية 1؛ نضرب في العامل 2.","En":"The standard exponential quotient tends to one; multiply by two."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف معامل الأس عند تغيير المتغير.","En":"Do not drop the exponent coefficient during substitution."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{e^u-1}{u}=1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\cdot1=2$","En":"$2\\cdot1=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}e^{2x}\\right|_{x=0}=2$","En":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}e^{2x}\\right|_{x=0}=2$"}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":16,"PrimarySkillId":70,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن صيغة النهاية الأسية الأساسية.","En":"Look for the fundamental exponential limit form."},{"Ar":"أعد كتابة الكسر بحيث يكون المقام مساوياً للأس الموجود في البسط مع إخراج المعامل المناسب.","En":"Rewrite so the denominator matches the exponent, accounting for the outside coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النهاية الأسية الأساسية: $\\lim_{u\\to0}(e^u-1)/u=1$. نعوض $u=2x$.","En":"Fundamental exponential limit: $\\lim_{u\\to0}(e^u-1)/u=1$. Substitute $u=2x$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضع $u=2x$، فيؤول u إلى الصفر.","En":"Set $u=2x$, which tends to zero."},{"Ar":"نعيد كتابة الكسر $2(e^u-1)/u$.","En":"Rewrite the quotient as $2(e^u-1)/u$."},{"Ar":"نهاية النسبة الأسية القياسية 1؛ نضرب في العامل 2.","En":"The standard exponential quotient tends to one; multiply by two."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحذف معامل الأس عند تغيير المتغير.","En":"Do not drop the exponent coefficient during substitution."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{u\\to0}\\frac{e^u-1}{u}=1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\cdot1=2$","En":"$2\\cdot1=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}e^{2x}\\right|_{x=0}=2$","En":"$\\left.\\frac{d}{dx}e^{2x}\\right|_{x=0}=2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"صفر البسط لا يعني نهاية صفر لأن المقام يقترب من صفر أيضاً.","En":"A vanishing numerator does not imply a zero limit when the denominator also vanishes."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 النهاية القياسية عند مقام 2x؛ نحتاج العامل 2.","En":"One is the standard limit with denominator 2x; a factor two remains."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"e² قيمة الدالة عند x=1 لا نهاية خارج القسمة عند صفر.","En":"e² is the exponential value at x=1, not the quotient limit at zero."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$النهاية الأسية الأساسية: $\lim_{u\to0}(e^u-1)/u=1$. نعوض $u=2x$.

$\lim_{u\to0}\frac{e^u-1}{u}=1$

1. نضع $u=2x$، فيؤول u إلى الصفر.

2. نعيد كتابة الكسر $2(e^u-1)/u$.

3. نهاية النسبة الأسية القياسية 1؛ نضرب في العامل 2.

$2\cdot1=2$

$2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\left.\frac{d}{dx}e^{2x}\right|_{x=0}=2$

لا تحذف معامل الأس عند تغيير المتغير.$mw$,$mw$Fundamental exponential limit: $\lim_{u\to0}(e^u-1)/u=1$. Substitute $u=2x$.

$\lim_{u\to0}\frac{e^u-1}{u}=1$

1. Set $u=2x$, which tends to zero.

2. Rewrite the quotient as $2(e^u-1)/u$.

3. The standard exponential quotient tends to one; multiply by two.

$2\cdot1=2$

$2$ Dimensionless

$\left.\frac{d}{dx}e^{2x}\right|_{x=0}=2$

Do not drop the exponent coefficient during substitution.$mw$),
(732,761,$mw$09F82C32FE7745D17C1F8875AFAB1425DD107605B9650528F2E2682BC2621A5F$mw$,$mw$92abb09f14a849522d2f1cd7babc8d86$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":761,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":1,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخراج كمية مستهلكة من كمية ابتدائية وباقية","TitleEn":"Determine a used quantity from an initial amount and remainder","QuestionTextAr":"خزان فيه 425 لتراً من الماء. بقي فيه 178 لتراً بعد استخدام بعض الماء. كم لتراً استُخدم؟","QuestionTextEn":"A tank initially holds 425 liters of water. After some water is used, 178 liters remain. How many liters were used?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون: الكمية المستخدمة = الكمية الأصلية − الكمية المتبقية. في الخزان 425 لتراً وبقي 178 لتراً. نحسب 425 − 178 = 247 لتراً مستخدماً. التحقق: 247 + 178 = 425.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule: Amount used = initial amount − remaining amount. The tank held 425 liters and 178 remain. Compute 425 − 178 = 247 liters used. Check: 247 + 178 = 425.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3033,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"237","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3034,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"247","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3035,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"253","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3036,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"603","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"المطلوب الكمية التي نقصت من الخزان.","En":"Find how much was removed from the tank."},{"Ar":"اطرح الكمية المتبقية من الكمية الأصلية.","En":"Subtract the remaining amount from the initial amount."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخراج كمية مستهلكة من كمية ابتدائية وباقية","En":"Determine a used quantity from an initial amount and remainder"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"237","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"237+178=415 وليس 425.","En":"237+178=415, not 425."}},{"LatexCode":"247","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"253","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"253+178=431 وليس 425.","En":"253+178=431, not 425."}},{"LatexCode":"603","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"603 مجموع الكميتين، لا الكمية المستخدمة.","En":"603 adds both quantities instead of finding the amount used."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"خزان فيه 425 لتراً من الماء. بقي فيه 178 لتراً بعد استخدام بعض الماء. كم لتراً استُخدم؟","En":"A tank initially holds 425 liters of water. After some water is used, 178 liters remain. How many liters were used?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المستهلك يساوي الكمية الأصلية ناقص المتبقي.","En":"Amount used equals initial amount minus remainder."},"Unit":{"Ar":"لتر","En":"L"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح المتبقي من الأصل: 425−178.","En":"Subtract remainder from initial amount: 425−178."},{"Ar":"في الآحاد نستلف عشرة: 15−8=7. في العشرات بقيت 1، فنستلف مئة: 11−7=4.","En":"Regroup one ten: 15−8=7. One ten remains; regroup a hundred: 11−7=4."},{"Ar":"تبقى ثلاث مئات؛ 3−1=2. الناتج 247.","En":"Three hundreds remain; 3−1=2. The result is 247."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$247$","En":"$247$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع المتبقي مع الأصل عند إيجاد المستهلك.","En":"Do not add the remainder to the initial amount when finding the amount used."},"FormulaLatex":"U=425-178","Substitution":{"Ar":"$425-178=247$","En":"$425-178=247$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$247+178=425$","En":"$247+178=425$"}},"TrackIds":[2],"CategoryId":1,"PrimarySkillId":2,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"المطلوب الكمية التي نقصت من الخزان.","En":"Find how much was removed from the tank."},{"Ar":"اطرح الكمية المتبقية من الكمية الأصلية.","En":"Subtract the remaining amount from the initial amount."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المستهلك يساوي الكمية الأصلية ناقص المتبقي.","En":"Amount used equals initial amount minus remainder."},"Unit":{"Ar":"لتر","En":"L"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نطرح المتبقي من الأصل: 425−178.","En":"Subtract remainder from initial amount: 425−178."},{"Ar":"في الآحاد نستلف عشرة: 15−8=7. في العشرات بقيت 1، فنستلف مئة: 11−7=4.","En":"Regroup one ten: 15−8=7. One ten remains; regroup a hundred: 11−7=4."},{"Ar":"تبقى ثلاث مئات؛ 3−1=2. الناتج 247.","En":"Three hundreds remain; 3−1=2. The result is 247."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$247$","En":"$247$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع المتبقي مع الأصل عند إيجاد المستهلك.","En":"Do not add the remainder to the initial amount when finding the amount used."},"FormulaLatex":"U=425-178","Substitution":{"Ar":"$425-178=247$","En":"$425-178=247$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$247+178=425$","En":"$247+178=425$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"237+178=415 وليس 425.","En":"237+178=415, not 425."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"253+178=431 وليس 425.","En":"253+178=431, not 425."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"603 مجموع الكميتين، لا الكمية المستخدمة.","En":"603 adds both quantities instead of finding the amount used."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المستهلك يساوي الكمية الأصلية ناقص المتبقي.

$U=425-178$

1. نطرح المتبقي من الأصل: 425−178.

2. في الآحاد نستلف عشرة: 15−8=7. في العشرات بقيت 1، فنستلف مئة: 11−7=4.

3. تبقى ثلاث مئات؛ 3−1=2. الناتج 247.

$425-178=247$

$247$ لتر

$247+178=425$

لا تجمع المتبقي مع الأصل عند إيجاد المستهلك.$mw$,$mw$Amount used equals initial amount minus remainder.

$U=425-178$

1. Subtract remainder from initial amount: 425−178.

2. Regroup one ten: 15−8=7. One ten remains; regroup a hundred: 11−7=4.

3. Three hundreds remain; 3−1=2. The result is 247.

$425-178=247$

$247$ L

$247+178=425$

Do not add the remainder to the initial amount when finding the amount used.$mw$),
(733,762,$mw$510D65A42753D53A61F6A8EE80DC4A95B7FEC3822CDC6D3272A07ADA3F371E7D$mw$,$mw$13a53b98a5740c0f4b9242338f23c14f$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":762,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":1,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخدام الطرح لإيجاد الفرق بين مجموعتين","TitleEn":"Compare two collections using subtraction","QuestionTextAr":"جمعت ليلى 650 ملصقاً، وجمع سامر 487 ملصقاً. بكم ملصقاً تزيد مجموعة ليلى؟","QuestionTextEn":"Layla collected 650 stickers and Samer collected 487. How many more stickers does Layla have?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ: فرق مجموعتين = العدد الأكبر − الأصغر. لدى ليلى 650 ملصقاً ولدى سامر 487، لذلك الفرق 650 − 487 = 163 ملصقاً. التحقق: 487 + 163 = 650.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule: The difference between two collections is the larger count minus the smaller. Layla has 650 stickers versus Samer's 487, so 650 − 487 = 163 more stickers. Check: 487 + 163 = 650.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3037,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"153","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3038,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"163","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3039,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"173","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3040,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1137","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المجموعة الأكبر.","En":"Identify the larger collection."},{"Ar":"اطرح الأصغر من الأكبر.","En":"Subtract the smaller count from the larger."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخدام الطرح لإيجاد الفرق بين مجموعتين","En":"Compare two collections using subtraction"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"153","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"153+487=640 وليس 650.","En":"153+487=640, not 650."}},{"LatexCode":"163","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"173","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"173+487=660 وليس 650.","En":"173+487=660, not 650."}},{"LatexCode":"1137","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1137 مجموع المجموعتين لا الفرق.","En":"1137 is their combined total, not the difference."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"جمعت ليلى 650 ملصقاً، وجمع سامر 487 ملصقاً. بكم ملصقاً تزيد مجموعة ليلى؟","En":"Layla collected 650 stickers and Samer collected 487. How many more stickers does Layla have?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"فرق الكميتين يساوي الأكبر ناقص الأصغر.","En":"The difference is the larger quantity minus the smaller."},"Unit":{"Ar":"ملصقاً","En":"stickers"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"مجموعة ليلى أكبر؛ نطرح 487 من 650.","En":"Layla has more; subtract 487 from 650."},{"Ar":"نستلف عشرة للآحاد: 10−7=3. ثم نستلف مئة للعشرات: 14−8=6.","En":"Regroup a ten for the ones: 10−7=3. Then regroup a hundred for the tens: 14−8=6."},{"Ar":"بقيت خمس مئات؛ 5−4=1. الفرق 163.","En":"Five hundreds remain; 5−4=1. The difference is 163."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$163$","En":"$163$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"تذكر إنقاص المنزلة التي استعرت منها.","En":"Remember to reduce the place from which you regrouped."},"FormulaLatex":"D=650-487","Substitution":{"Ar":"$650-487=163$","En":"$650-487=163$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$487+163=650$","En":"$487+163=650$"}},"TrackIds":[2],"CategoryId":1,"PrimarySkillId":2,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المجموعة الأكبر.","En":"Identify the larger collection."},{"Ar":"اطرح الأصغر من الأكبر.","En":"Subtract the smaller count from the larger."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"فرق الكميتين يساوي الأكبر ناقص الأصغر.","En":"The difference is the larger quantity minus the smaller."},"Unit":{"Ar":"ملصقاً","En":"stickers"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"مجموعة ليلى أكبر؛ نطرح 487 من 650.","En":"Layla has more; subtract 487 from 650."},{"Ar":"نستلف عشرة للآحاد: 10−7=3. ثم نستلف مئة للعشرات: 14−8=6.","En":"Regroup a ten for the ones: 10−7=3. Then regroup a hundred for the tens: 14−8=6."},{"Ar":"بقيت خمس مئات؛ 5−4=1. الفرق 163.","En":"Five hundreds remain; 5−4=1. The difference is 163."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$163$","En":"$163$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"تذكر إنقاص المنزلة التي استعرت منها.","En":"Remember to reduce the place from which you regrouped."},"FormulaLatex":"D=650-487","Substitution":{"Ar":"$650-487=163$","En":"$650-487=163$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$487+163=650$","En":"$487+163=650$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"153+487=640 وليس 650.","En":"153+487=640, not 650."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"173+487=660 وليس 650.","En":"173+487=660, not 650."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1137 مجموع المجموعتين لا الفرق.","En":"1137 is their combined total, not the difference."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$فرق الكميتين يساوي الأكبر ناقص الأصغر.

$D=650-487$

1. مجموعة ليلى أكبر؛ نطرح 487 من 650.

2. نستلف عشرة للآحاد: 10−7=3. ثم نستلف مئة للعشرات: 14−8=6.

3. بقيت خمس مئات؛ 5−4=1. الفرق 163.

$650-487=163$

$163$ ملصقاً

$487+163=650$

تذكر إنقاص المنزلة التي استعرت منها.$mw$,$mw$The difference is the larger quantity minus the smaller.

$D=650-487$

1. Layla has more; subtract 487 from 650.

2. Regroup a ten for the ones: 10−7=3. Then regroup a hundred for the tens: 14−8=6.

3. Five hundreds remain; 5−4=1. The difference is 163.

$650-487=163$

$163$ stickers

$487+163=650$

Remember to reduce the place from which you regrouped.$mw$),
(734,763,$mw$01925F93DB9FFC5B5334D6BC606E6C7DF157A9430CC628374312763AF9C6F003$mw$,$mw$34131bd081c7efcd1fed1e2aa2da6606$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":763,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":1,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استنتاج العدد الأصلي باستعمال علاقة الطرح والجمع","TitleEn":"Find a starting amount from a subtraction relation","QuestionTextAr":"بعد سحب 38 بطاقة من صندوق بقيت 95 بطاقة. كم بطاقة كانت في الصندوق قبل السحب؟","QuestionTextEn":"After 38 cards were removed from a box, 95 remained. How many cards were in the box originally?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون: العدد الأصلي = العدد المسحوب + العدد المتبقي. سُحبت 38 بطاقة وبقيت 95، إذن الأصل = 38 + 95 = 133 بطاقة. التحقق: 133 − 38 = 95.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule: Original quantity = removed quantity + remaining quantity. With 38 cards removed and 95 left, the starting quantity was 38 + 95 = 133. Check: 133 − 38 = 95.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3041,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"57","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3042,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"123","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3043,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"133","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3044,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"143","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"العدد الأصلي يشمل البطاقات التي سُحبت.","En":"The original count includes the removed cards."},{"Ar":"اجمع المتبقي مع المسحوب.","En":"Add the remainder and removed count."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استنتاج العدد الأصلي باستعمال علاقة الطرح والجمع","En":"Find a starting amount from a subtraction relation"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"57","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"57 ينتج من طرح المسحوب من المتبقي مرة أخرى.","En":"57 subtracts the removed cards from the remainder again."}},{"LatexCode":"123","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"123−38=85 وليس 95.","En":"123−38=85, not 95."}},{"LatexCode":"133","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"143","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"143−38=105 وليس 95.","En":"143−38=105, not 95."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"بعد سحب 38 بطاقة من صندوق بقيت 95 بطاقة. كم بطاقة كانت في الصندوق قبل السحب؟","En":"After 38 cards were removed from a box, 95 remained. How many cards were in the box originally?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"العدد الأصلي يساوي العدد المتبقي زائد العدد المسحوب.","En":"The original count equals the remainder plus the removed count."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بطاقة","En":"cards"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العدد الأصلي يشمل 95 بطاقة باقية و38 مسحوبة.","En":"The original count includes 95 remaining and 38 removed."},{"Ar":"نجمع الآحاد 5+8=13، نكتب 3 ونحمل عشرة.","En":"Add ones 5+8=13; write three and carry one ten."},{"Ar":"نجمع العشرات 9+3+1=13؛ فيكون العدد 133.","En":"Add tens 9+3+1=13; the total is 133."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$133$","En":"$133$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"اعكس عملية السحب بالجمع، لا بطرح جديد.","En":"Reverse removal using addition, not another subtraction."},"FormulaLatex":"N-38=95\\Rightarrow N=95+38","Substitution":{"Ar":"$95+38=133$","En":"$95+38=133$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$133-38=95$","En":"$133-38=95$"}},"TrackIds":[2],"CategoryId":1,"PrimarySkillId":2,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"العدد الأصلي يشمل البطاقات التي سُحبت.","En":"The original count includes the removed cards."},{"Ar":"اجمع المتبقي مع المسحوب.","En":"Add the remainder and removed count."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"العدد الأصلي يساوي العدد المتبقي زائد العدد المسحوب.","En":"The original count equals the remainder plus the removed count."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بطاقة","En":"cards"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العدد الأصلي يشمل 95 بطاقة باقية و38 مسحوبة.","En":"The original count includes 95 remaining and 38 removed."},{"Ar":"نجمع الآحاد 5+8=13، نكتب 3 ونحمل عشرة.","En":"Add ones 5+8=13; write three and carry one ten."},{"Ar":"نجمع العشرات 9+3+1=13؛ فيكون العدد 133.","En":"Add tens 9+3+1=13; the total is 133."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$133$","En":"$133$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"اعكس عملية السحب بالجمع، لا بطرح جديد.","En":"Reverse removal using addition, not another subtraction."},"FormulaLatex":"N-38=95\\Rightarrow N=95+38","Substitution":{"Ar":"$95+38=133$","En":"$95+38=133$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$133-38=95$","En":"$133-38=95$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"57 ينتج من طرح المسحوب من المتبقي مرة أخرى.","En":"57 subtracts the removed cards from the remainder again."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"123−38=85 وليس 95.","En":"123−38=85, not 95."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"143−38=105 وليس 95.","En":"143−38=105, not 95."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$العدد الأصلي يساوي العدد المتبقي زائد العدد المسحوب.

$N-38=95\Rightarrow N=95+38$

1. العدد الأصلي يشمل 95 بطاقة باقية و38 مسحوبة.

2. نجمع الآحاد 5+8=13، نكتب 3 ونحمل عشرة.

3. نجمع العشرات 9+3+1=13؛ فيكون العدد 133.

$95+38=133$

$133$ بطاقة

$133-38=95$

اعكس عملية السحب بالجمع، لا بطرح جديد.$mw$,$mw$The original count equals the remainder plus the removed count.

$N-38=95\Rightarrow N=95+38$

1. The original count includes 95 remaining and 38 removed.

2. Add ones 5+8=13; write three and carry one ten.

3. Add tens 9+3+1=13; the total is 133.

$95+38=133$

$133$ cards

$133-38=95$

Reverse removal using addition, not another subtraction.$mw$),
(735,764,$mw$F99574D190B1D39E1405A56554C7EC80725A641C705EA56F6EEF3B9D4C73C4A3$mw$,$mw$2e35812f8b23f1617bdb1caa737c02a4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":764,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":1,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تطبيق الاستلاف عبر الصفر في عملية طرح","TitleEn":"Regroup across zero in a subtraction","QuestionTextAr":"احسب 503 − 287 مع الانتباه إلى الاستلاف من المئات.","QuestionTextEn":"Calculate 503 − 287, paying attention to regrouping through the zero tens digit.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ: عند وجود صفر في منزلة العشرات نستلف من المئات ونعيد التجميع. نعيد كتابة 503 كـ 4 مئات و9 عشرات و13 آحاداً. ثم 13 − 7 = 6 و9 − 8 = 1 و4 − 2 = 2. الناتج 216؛ التحقق: 216 + 287 = 503.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule: Regroup across a zero tens digit by borrowing from the hundreds. Rewrite 503 as 4 hundreds, 9 tens and 13 ones. Then 13 − 7 = 6, 9 − 8 = 1, and 4 − 2 = 2. Result: 216. Check: 216 + 287 = 503.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3045,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"206","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3046,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"216","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3047,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"224","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3048,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"316","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإعادة التجميع من المئات لأن العشرات صفر.","En":"Start regrouping from the hundreds because the tens digit is zero."},{"Ar":"حوّل مئة إلى عشر عشرات ثم حوّل عشرة إلى آحاد.","En":"Convert a hundred to ten tens, then one ten to ones."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تطبيق الاستلاف عبر الصفر في عملية طرح","En":"Regroup across zero in a subtraction"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"206","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"206+287=493 وليس 503.","En":"206+287=493, not 503."}},{"LatexCode":"216","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"224","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"224+287=511 وليس 503.","En":"224+287=511, not 503."}},{"LatexCode":"316","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"316+287=603؛ نسي إنقاص المئات بعد الاستلاف.","En":"316+287=603; the hundreds were not reduced after regrouping."}}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب 503 − 287 مع الانتباه إلى الاستلاف من المئات.","En":"Calculate 503 − 287, paying attention to regrouping through the zero tens digit."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الطرح بالقيمة المكانية يتطلب إعادة التجميع عندما لا تكفي الآحاد.","En":"Place-value subtraction requires regrouping when ones are insufficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحوّل مئة من الخمس إلى عشر عشرات: 4 مئات و10 عشرات و3 آحاد.","En":"Regroup one of five hundreds as ten tens: four hundreds, ten tens, three ones."},{"Ar":"نحوّل عشرة إلى آحاد: 4 مئات و9 عشرات و13 آحاداً.","En":"Regroup one ten as ones: four hundreds, nine tens, thirteen ones."},{"Ar":"نطرح بحسب المنازل: 13−7=6، 9−8=1، 4−2=2.","En":"Subtract by place: 13−7=6, 9−8=1, 4−2=2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$216$","En":"$216$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"عند الاستلاف عبر الصفر لا تترك العشرات 10 بعد نقل واحدة إلى الآحاد.","En":"When regrouping through zero, do not leave ten tens after moving one into ones."},"FormulaLatex":"503=400+90+13","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(400-200)+(90-80)+(13-7)=216$","En":"$(400-200)+(90-80)+(13-7)=216$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$216+287=503$","En":"$216+287=503$"}},"TrackIds":[2],"CategoryId":1,"PrimarySkillId":2,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإعادة التجميع من المئات لأن العشرات صفر.","En":"Start regrouping from the hundreds because the tens digit is zero."},{"Ar":"حوّل مئة إلى عشر عشرات ثم حوّل عشرة إلى آحاد.","En":"Convert a hundred to ten tens, then one ten to ones."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الطرح بالقيمة المكانية يتطلب إعادة التجميع عندما لا تكفي الآحاد.","En":"Place-value subtraction requires regrouping when ones are insufficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحوّل مئة من الخمس إلى عشر عشرات: 4 مئات و10 عشرات و3 آحاد.","En":"Regroup one of five hundreds as ten tens: four hundreds, ten tens, three ones."},{"Ar":"نحوّل عشرة إلى آحاد: 4 مئات و9 عشرات و13 آحاداً.","En":"Regroup one ten as ones: four hundreds, nine tens, thirteen ones."},{"Ar":"نطرح بحسب المنازل: 13−7=6، 9−8=1، 4−2=2.","En":"Subtract by place: 13−7=6, 9−8=1, 4−2=2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$216$","En":"$216$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"عند الاستلاف عبر الصفر لا تترك العشرات 10 بعد نقل واحدة إلى الآحاد.","En":"When regrouping through zero, do not leave ten tens after moving one into ones."},"FormulaLatex":"503=400+90+13","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(400-200)+(90-80)+(13-7)=216$","En":"$(400-200)+(90-80)+(13-7)=216$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$216+287=503$","En":"$216+287=503$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"206+287=493 وليس 503.","En":"206+287=493, not 503."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"224+287=511 وليس 503.","En":"224+287=511, not 503."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"316+287=603؛ نسي إنقاص المئات بعد الاستلاف.","En":"316+287=603; the hundreds were not reduced after regrouping."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الطرح بالقيمة المكانية يتطلب إعادة التجميع عندما لا تكفي الآحاد.

$503=400+90+13$

1. نحوّل مئة من الخمس إلى عشر عشرات: 4 مئات و10 عشرات و3 آحاد.

2. نحوّل عشرة إلى آحاد: 4 مئات و9 عشرات و13 آحاداً.

3. نطرح بحسب المنازل: 13−7=6، 9−8=1، 4−2=2.

$(400-200)+(90-80)+(13-7)=216$

$216$ بلا وحدة قياس

$216+287=503$

عند الاستلاف عبر الصفر لا تترك العشرات 10 بعد نقل واحدة إلى الآحاد.$mw$,$mw$Place-value subtraction requires regrouping when ones are insufficient.

$503=400+90+13$

1. Regroup one of five hundreds as ten tens: four hundreds, ten tens, three ones.

2. Regroup one ten as ones: four hundreds, nine tens, thirteen ones.

3. Subtract by place: 13−7=6, 9−8=1, 4−2=2.

$(400-200)+(90-80)+(13-7)=216$

$216$ Dimensionless

$216+287=503$

When regrouping through zero, do not leave ten tens after moving one into ones.$mw$),
(736,765,$mw$5EEB2CDCC60ED10E385D4B82CD8E288BE147AA9FF194604D2AAEBA940D118943$mw$,$mw$d9c1f84998409d792769340d089be1cc$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":765,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":5,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تقييم قوة فردية لعدد سالب","TitleEn":"Evaluate an odd power of a negative base","QuestionTextAr":"ما قيمة (−4)³؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the value of (−4)³?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: القوة الثالثة تعني ضرب العدد في نفسه ثلاث مرات، والإشارة السالبة تبقى سالبة عند تكرار عدد سالب عدداً فردياً من المرات. بالتعويض: (−4)³ = (−4) × (−4) × (−4) = 16 × (−4) = −64. الأقواس مهمة لأن الأس يتناول العدد السالب كله.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Cubing a number multiplies it by itself three times. The product of three negative factors is negative. Therefore (−4)³ = (−4) × (−4) × (−4) = 16 × (−4) = −64. Parentheses ensure the negative sign is part of the base.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3049,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-64","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3050,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3051,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3052,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"64","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى أن الأساس السالب داخل القوس.","En":"Notice that the negative base is inside parentheses."},{"Ar":"كرر ضرب العامل السالب ثلاث مرات وراعِ قاعدة الإشارات.","En":"Multiply the negative factor three times and apply sign rules."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تقييم قوة فردية لعدد سالب","En":"Evaluate an odd power of a negative base"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"-64","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"-12","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−12 ناتج ضرب الأساس في الأس، لا رفعه للقوة الثالثة.","En":"−12 multiplies the base by the exponent rather than cubing it."}},{"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12 يهمل قاعدة الأس والإشارة معاً.","En":"12 ignores both the exponent rule and sign."}},{"LatexCode":"64","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"64 مقدار الناتج لكن القوة الفردية لأساس سالب سالبة.","En":"64 is the magnitude, but an odd power of a negative base is negative."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما قيمة (−4)³؟","En":"What is the value of (−4)³?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القوة الفردية لعدد سالب سالبة؛ نكرر ضرب الأساس.","En":"An odd power of a negative number is negative; multiply the repeated base."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القوة الثالثة تعني ثلاثة عوامل من الأساس نفسه.","En":"Cubing means three copies of the base as factors."},{"Ar":"حاصل ضرب العاملين الأولين موجب: (−4)(−4)=16.","En":"The first two factors give positive 16."},{"Ar":"نضرب 16 في −4 فنحصل على −64.","En":"Multiply 16 by −4 to obtain −64."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-64$","En":"$-64$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب الأساس في الأس ولا تهمل الإشارة.","En":"Do not multiply base by exponent or ignore the sign."},"FormulaLatex":"(-4)^3=(-4)(-4)(-4)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$16(-4)=-64$","En":"$16(-4)=-64$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$|(-4)^3|=4^3=64$","En":"$|(-4)^3|=4^3=64$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":5,"PrimarySkillId":23,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى أن الأساس السالب داخل القوس.","En":"Notice that the negative base is inside parentheses."},{"Ar":"كرر ضرب العامل السالب ثلاث مرات وراعِ قاعدة الإشارات.","En":"Multiply the negative factor three times and apply sign rules."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القوة الفردية لعدد سالب سالبة؛ نكرر ضرب الأساس.","En":"An odd power of a negative number is negative; multiply the repeated base."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القوة الثالثة تعني ثلاثة عوامل من الأساس نفسه.","En":"Cubing means three copies of the base as factors."},{"Ar":"حاصل ضرب العاملين الأولين موجب: (−4)(−4)=16.","En":"The first two factors give positive 16."},{"Ar":"نضرب 16 في −4 فنحصل على −64.","En":"Multiply 16 by −4 to obtain −64."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-64$","En":"$-64$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب الأساس في الأس ولا تهمل الإشارة.","En":"Do not multiply base by exponent or ignore the sign."},"FormulaLatex":"(-4)^3=(-4)(-4)(-4)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$16(-4)=-64$","En":"$16(-4)=-64$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$|(-4)^3|=4^3=64$","En":"$|(-4)^3|=4^3=64$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−12 ناتج ضرب الأساس في الأس، لا رفعه للقوة الثالثة.","En":"−12 multiplies the base by the exponent rather than cubing it."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12 يهمل قاعدة الأس والإشارة معاً.","En":"12 ignores both the exponent rule and sign."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"64 مقدار الناتج لكن القوة الفردية لأساس سالب سالبة.","En":"64 is the magnitude, but an odd power of a negative base is negative."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القوة الفردية لعدد سالب سالبة؛ نكرر ضرب الأساس.

$(-4)^3=(-4)(-4)(-4)$

1. القوة الثالثة تعني ثلاثة عوامل من الأساس نفسه.

2. حاصل ضرب العاملين الأولين موجب: (−4)(−4)=16.

3. نضرب 16 في −4 فنحصل على −64.

$16(-4)=-64$

$-64$ بلا وحدة قياس

$|(-4)^3|=4^3=64$

لا تضرب الأساس في الأس ولا تهمل الإشارة.$mw$,$mw$An odd power of a negative number is negative; multiply the repeated base.

$(-4)^3=(-4)(-4)(-4)$

1. Cubing means three copies of the base as factors.

2. The first two factors give positive 16.

3. Multiply 16 by −4 to obtain −64.

$16(-4)=-64$

$-64$ Dimensionless

$|(-4)^3|=4^3=64$

Do not multiply base by exponent or ignore the sign.$mw$),
(737,766,$mw$AAC49EFABDAD6DA7B4FEFD7C23F0F8A409AD134EB24818BAF82228237676AB48$mw$,$mw$168f1c91cc5626c0c9006d937f8558a4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":766,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":5,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تفسير الأس الصفري لعدد غير صفري","TitleEn":"Explain the zero-exponent law","QuestionTextAr":"أي قيمة تساوي 17⁰؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is 17 to the power zero?","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون الأس صفر: لأي عدد غير صفري أ، يكون أ⁰ = 1. العدد 17 غير صفري، وبالتالي 17⁰ = 1. ويمكن تفسيره بقانون قسمة الأسس: 17³ ÷ 17³ = 17^(3−3) = 17⁰، وبما أن العدد مقسوماً على نفسه يساوي 1، فالنتيجة 1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Zero-exponent law: For any nonzero a, a⁰ = 1. Since 17 is nonzero, 17⁰ = 1. Verify with the quotient law: 17³ ÷ 17³ = 17^(3−3) = 17⁰, but a nonzero number divided by itself equals 1.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3053,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3054,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3055,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"17","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3056,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"170","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة قسمة قوتين للأساس نفسه.","En":"Use the quotient rule for equal bases."},{"Ar":"فكر في قسمة قوتين متساويتين للأساس 17.","En":"Consider dividing two equal powers of base 17."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تفسير الأس الصفري لعدد غير صفري","En":"Explain the zero-exponent law"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الأس الصفري لا يجعل قيمة القوة صفراً لأساس غير صفري.","En":"Zero exponent does not make a nonzero base's power zero."}},{"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"17","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"17 هو الأساس، لا قيمة قوته الصفرية.","En":"17 is the base, not its zeroth power."}},{"LatexCode":"170","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"إلحاق صفر بالعدد لا يمثل رفعه للأس صفر.","En":"Appending zero does not represent raising to power zero."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"أي قيمة تساوي 17⁰؟","En":"What is 17 to the power zero?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأس الصفري لأساس غير صفري يتبع قاعدة قسمة القوى.","En":"The zero-power rule for a nonzero base follows from division of powers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس 17 غير صفري.","En":"The base 17 is nonzero."},{"Ar":"نقسم $17^2$ على نفسه، فنحصل على 1.","En":"Divide $17^2$ by itself to get one."},{"Ar":"وبقاعدة قسمة القوى يساوي ذلك $17^{2-2}=17^0$.","En":"The quotient rule also gives $17^{2-2}=17^0$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$1$","En":"$1$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعمم القاعدة على 0⁰ دون تحديد السياق.","En":"Do not generalize the rule to 0⁰ without specifying context."},"FormulaLatex":"a^m/a^m=a^0=1,\\quad a\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$17^0=1$","En":"$17^0=1$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$289/289=1$","En":"$289/289=1$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":5,"PrimarySkillId":23,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة قسمة قوتين للأساس نفسه.","En":"Use the quotient rule for equal bases."},{"Ar":"فكر في قسمة قوتين متساويتين للأساس 17.","En":"Consider dividing two equal powers of base 17."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأس الصفري لأساس غير صفري يتبع قاعدة قسمة القوى.","En":"The zero-power rule for a nonzero base follows from division of powers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس 17 غير صفري.","En":"The base 17 is nonzero."},{"Ar":"نقسم $17^2$ على نفسه، فنحصل على 1.","En":"Divide $17^2$ by itself to get one."},{"Ar":"وبقاعدة قسمة القوى يساوي ذلك $17^{2-2}=17^0$.","En":"The quotient rule also gives $17^{2-2}=17^0$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$1$","En":"$1$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعمم القاعدة على 0⁰ دون تحديد السياق.","En":"Do not generalize the rule to 0⁰ without specifying context."},"FormulaLatex":"a^m/a^m=a^0=1,\\quad a\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$17^0=1$","En":"$17^0=1$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$289/289=1$","En":"$289/289=1$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الأس الصفري لا يجعل قيمة القوة صفراً لأساس غير صفري.","En":"Zero exponent does not make a nonzero base's power zero."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"17 هو الأساس، لا قيمة قوته الصفرية.","En":"17 is the base, not its zeroth power."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"إلحاق صفر بالعدد لا يمثل رفعه للأس صفر.","En":"Appending zero does not represent raising to power zero."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الأس الصفري لأساس غير صفري يتبع قاعدة قسمة القوى.

$a^m/a^m=a^0=1,\quad a\ne0$

1. الأساس 17 غير صفري.

2. نقسم $17^2$ على نفسه، فنحصل على 1.

3. وبقاعدة قسمة القوى يساوي ذلك $17^{2-2}=17^0$.

$17^0=1$

$1$ بلا وحدة قياس

$289/289=1$

لا تعمم القاعدة على 0⁰ دون تحديد السياق.$mw$,$mw$The zero-power rule for a nonzero base follows from division of powers.

$a^m/a^m=a^0=1,\quad a\ne0$

1. The base 17 is nonzero.

2. Divide $17^2$ by itself to get one.

3. The quotient rule also gives $17^{2-2}=17^0$.

$17^0=1$

$1$ Dimensionless

$289/289=1$

Do not generalize the rule to 0⁰ without specifying context.$mw$),
(738,767,$mw$D0E541DBCF4DCC8AB34BB890219646CB14A00EAE42B7CEDE4255602ED196143F$mw$,$mw$e3ac32fcd8b23ceb78840996b48f89a6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":767,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":5,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تقييم أس سالب بوصفه مقلوب قوة موجبة","TitleEn":"Evaluate a negative exponent as a reciprocal","QuestionTextAr":"احسب 2⁻³ واكتب الناتج ككسر مبسط.","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate 2^(-3) and express the result as a simplified fraction.","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون الأس السالب: أ^(−ن) = 1 ÷ أ^ن لأي أساس غير صفري. إذن 2^(−3) = 1 ÷ 2³. نحسب 2³ = 2 × 2 × 2 = 8، فيكون الناتج 1/8 في أبسط صورة. الأس السالب لا يعني أن نتيجة القوة عدد سالب.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Negative-exponent law: a^(−n) = 1/a^n for nonzero base a. Thus 2^(−3) = 1/2³. Compute 2³ = 2 × 2 × 2 = 8; the simplified result is 1/8. A negative exponent does not make the value negative.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3057,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac18","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3058,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3059,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3060,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"الأس السالب لا يعني أن الناتج سالب.","En":"A negative exponent does not make the result negative."},{"Ar":"حوّل القوة إلى مقلوب قوة ذات أس موجب ثم احسب المقام.","En":"Rewrite as the reciprocal of a positive power, then evaluate the denominator."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تقييم أس سالب بوصفه مقلوب قوة موجبة","En":"Evaluate a negative exponent as a reciprocal"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\frac18","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\frac13","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"المقام هو 2³=8 وليس قيمة الأس 3.","En":"The denominator is 2³=8, not exponent three."}},{"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 ناتج ضرب 2 في 3 لا تطبيق الأس السالب.","En":"Six multiplies two by three rather than applying a negative exponent."}},{"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8 قيمة 2³ لا 2⁻³.","En":"Eight is 2³, not 2⁻³."}}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب 2⁻³ واكتب الناتج ككسر مبسط.","En":"Evaluate 2^(-3) and express the result as a simplified fraction."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأس السالب يعطي مقلوب القوة ذات الأس الموجب.","En":"A negative exponent gives the reciprocal of the positive power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس 2 غير صفري؛ الأس السالب يعني المقلوب.","En":"Base two is nonzero; a negative exponent means reciprocal."},{"Ar":"نحسب $2^3=2\\cdot2\\cdot2=8$.","En":"Compute $2^3=2\\cdot2\\cdot2=8$."},{"Ar":"نأخذ المقلوب 1/8، وهو في أبسط صورة.","En":"Take reciprocal 1/8, already in simplest form."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac18$","En":"$\\frac18$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الأس السالب ليس إشارة سالبة للناتج.","En":"A negative exponent is not a negative sign on the result."},"FormulaLatex":"a^{-n}=\\frac1{a^n},\\quad a\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2^{-3}=1/8$","En":"$2^{-3}=1/8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2^{-3}2^3=(1/8)8=1$","En":"$2^{-3}2^3=(1/8)8=1$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":5,"PrimarySkillId":23,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"الأس السالب لا يعني أن الناتج سالب.","En":"A negative exponent does not make the result negative."},{"Ar":"حوّل القوة إلى مقلوب قوة ذات أس موجب ثم احسب المقام.","En":"Rewrite as the reciprocal of a positive power, then evaluate the denominator."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأس السالب يعطي مقلوب القوة ذات الأس الموجب.","En":"A negative exponent gives the reciprocal of the positive power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس 2 غير صفري؛ الأس السالب يعني المقلوب.","En":"Base two is nonzero; a negative exponent means reciprocal."},{"Ar":"نحسب $2^3=2\\cdot2\\cdot2=8$.","En":"Compute $2^3=2\\cdot2\\cdot2=8$."},{"Ar":"نأخذ المقلوب 1/8، وهو في أبسط صورة.","En":"Take reciprocal 1/8, already in simplest form."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac18$","En":"$\\frac18$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الأس السالب ليس إشارة سالبة للناتج.","En":"A negative exponent is not a negative sign on the result."},"FormulaLatex":"a^{-n}=\\frac1{a^n},\\quad a\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2^{-3}=1/8$","En":"$2^{-3}=1/8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2^{-3}2^3=(1/8)8=1$","En":"$2^{-3}2^3=(1/8)8=1$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"المقام هو 2³=8 وليس قيمة الأس 3.","En":"The denominator is 2³=8, not exponent three."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 ناتج ضرب 2 في 3 لا تطبيق الأس السالب.","En":"Six multiplies two by three rather than applying a negative exponent."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8 قيمة 2³ لا 2⁻³.","En":"Eight is 2³, not 2⁻³."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الأس السالب يعطي مقلوب القوة ذات الأس الموجب.

$a^{-n}=\frac1{a^n},\quad a\ne0$

1. الأساس 2 غير صفري؛ الأس السالب يعني المقلوب.

2. نحسب $2^3=2\cdot2\cdot2=8$.

3. نأخذ المقلوب 1/8، وهو في أبسط صورة.

$2^{-3}=1/8$

$\frac18$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2^{-3}2^3=(1/8)8=1$

الأس السالب ليس إشارة سالبة للناتج.$mw$,$mw$A negative exponent gives the reciprocal of the positive power.

$a^{-n}=\frac1{a^n},\quad a\ne0$

1. Base two is nonzero; a negative exponent means reciprocal.

2. Compute $2^3=2\cdot2\cdot2=8$.

3. Take reciprocal 1/8, already in simplest form.

$2^{-3}=1/8$

$\frac18$ Dimensionless

$2^{-3}2^3=(1/8)8=1$

A negative exponent is not a negative sign on the result.$mw$),
(739,769,$mw$DDBE488D7B798D9144C75263359F06AB2E48D0E1282C51B655BC94D7CED9526B$mw$,$mw$b09d8ed98abd54369a009e63dcea5c62$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":769,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تمييز الجذر المكرر من التحليل","TitleEn":"Recognize a repeated quadratic root","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد الجذر الحقيقي للمعادلة x² − 10x + 25 = 0.","QuestionTextEn":"Find the real root of x² − 10x + 25 = 0.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: تحليل المربع الكامل. كثير الحدود س² − 10س + 25 يساوي (س − 5)² لأن −10 = −2×5 و25 = 5². إذن (س − 5)² = 0، وبالتالي س = 5. يسمى جذراً مكرراً لأن المميز يساوي 100 − 100 = 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Perfect-square factoring. The polynomial x²−10x+25=(x−5)² because −10=−2×5 and 25=5². Solving (x−5)²=0 gives x=5, a repeated root. Its discriminant also confirms this: 100−100=0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3065,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3066,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3067,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3068,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ أن الحد الثابت مربع كامل.","En":"Notice the constant is a perfect square."},{"Ar":"حلل التعبير إلى مربع عامل خطي وساو العامل بالصفر.","En":"Factor the expression as a squared linear factor and set it to zero."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تمييز الجذر المكرر من التحليل","En":"Recognize a repeated quadratic root"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"-5","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عند x=−5 يكون (x−5)²=100 لا صفر.","En":"At x=−5, (x−5)²=100, not zero."}},{"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عند x=0 يكون المقدار 25.","En":"At x=0 the expression is 25."}},{"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عند x=10 يكون المقدار 25.","En":"At x=10 the expression is 25."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد الجذر الحقيقي للمعادلة x² − 10x + 25 = 0.","En":"Find the real root of x² − 10x + 25 = 0."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المربع الكامل يملك جذراً مكرراً عندما يساوي صفراً.","En":"A perfect-square quadratic has a repeated root when equal to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"25=5² والحد الأوسط −2×5x، إذن المقدار مربع كامل.","En":"25=5² and the middle term is −2×5x, so the expression is a perfect square."},{"Ar":"نحلل إلى $(x-5)^2=0$.","En":"Factor as $(x-5)^2=0$."},{"Ar":"المربع يساوي صفر فقط عندما يكون أساسه صفراً؛ إذن x=5.","En":"A square is zero only when its base is zero; hence x=5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجذر مكرر لكن لا توجد قيمتان مختلفتان.","En":"The root is repeated, not two distinct values."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2-10x+25=(x-5)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x-5=0\\Rightarrow x=5$","En":"$x-5=0\\Rightarrow x=5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5^2-10(5)+25=0$","En":"$5^2-10(5)+25=0$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":41,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ أن الحد الثابت مربع كامل.","En":"Notice the constant is a perfect square."},{"Ar":"حلل التعبير إلى مربع عامل خطي وساو العامل بالصفر.","En":"Factor the expression as a squared linear factor and set it to zero."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المربع الكامل يملك جذراً مكرراً عندما يساوي صفراً.","En":"A perfect-square quadratic has a repeated root when equal to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"25=5² والحد الأوسط −2×5x، إذن المقدار مربع كامل.","En":"25=5² and the middle term is −2×5x, so the expression is a perfect square."},{"Ar":"نحلل إلى $(x-5)^2=0$.","En":"Factor as $(x-5)^2=0$."},{"Ar":"المربع يساوي صفر فقط عندما يكون أساسه صفراً؛ إذن x=5.","En":"A square is zero only when its base is zero; hence x=5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجذر مكرر لكن لا توجد قيمتان مختلفتان.","En":"The root is repeated, not two distinct values."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2-10x+25=(x-5)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x-5=0\\Rightarrow x=5$","En":"$x-5=0\\Rightarrow x=5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5^2-10(5)+25=0$","En":"$5^2-10(5)+25=0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عند x=−5 يكون (x−5)²=100 لا صفر.","En":"At x=−5, (x−5)²=100, not zero."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عند x=0 يكون المقدار 25.","En":"At x=0 the expression is 25."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"عند x=10 يكون المقدار 25.","En":"At x=10 the expression is 25."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المربع الكامل يملك جذراً مكرراً عندما يساوي صفراً.

$x^2-10x+25=(x-5)^2$

1. 25=5² والحد الأوسط −2×5x، إذن المقدار مربع كامل.

2. نحلل إلى $(x-5)^2=0$.

3. المربع يساوي صفر فقط عندما يكون أساسه صفراً؛ إذن x=5.

$x-5=0\Rightarrow x=5$

$5$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5^2-10(5)+25=0$

الجذر مكرر لكن لا توجد قيمتان مختلفتان.$mw$,$mw$A perfect-square quadratic has a repeated root when equal to zero.

$x^2-10x+25=(x-5)^2$

1. 25=5² and the middle term is −2×5x, so the expression is a perfect square.

2. Factor as $(x-5)^2=0$.

3. A square is zero only when its base is zero; hence x=5.

$x-5=0\Rightarrow x=5$

$5$ Dimensionless

$5^2-10(5)+25=0$

The root is repeated, not two distinct values.$mw$),
(740,770,$mw$9CDA704512800F2A071FD91CBE4769D17033183CCE7A61CD4DDC7ABF23160E0F$mw$,$mw$4283c6c6980ca6622bb46f44118e041a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":770,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل معادلة تربيعية معاملها الرئيسي لا يساوي الواحد","TitleEn":"Solve a quadratic whose leading coefficient is not one","QuestionTextAr":"ما جذرا المعادلة 2x² − 7x + 3 = 0؟","QuestionTextEn":"What are the roots of 2x² − 7x + 3 = 0?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: تحليل المعادلة التربيعية واستخدام حاصل الضرب الصفري. نحل 2س² − 7س + 3 = (2س − 1)(س − 3) = 0. من العامل الأول 2س − 1 = 0 فنجد س = 1/2، ومن الثاني س − 3 = 0 فنجد س = 3. مجموعة الجذور هي {1/2، 3}.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Factor the quadratic and use the zero-product property. Since 2x²−7x+3=(2x−1)(x−3), each factor may be set to zero. Solving 2x−1=0 gives x=1/2, and x−3=0 gives x=3. Both roots satisfy the original equation.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3069,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\{3,\\frac12\\}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3070,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\{3,-\\frac12\\}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3071,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\{-3,\\frac12\\}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3072,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\{1,3\\}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن تحليل يراعي معامل x² غير الواحد.","En":"Look for factors accounting for the non-unit leading coefficient."},{"Ar":"ساو كل عامل بالصفر، أو استخدم القانون العام.","En":"Set each factor to zero or use the quadratic formula."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل معادلة تربيعية معاملها الرئيسي لا يساوي الواحد","En":"Solve a quadratic whose leading coefficient is not one"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"\\{3,\\frac12\\}","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"\\{3,-\\frac12\\}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1/2 لا يحقق المعادلة؛ يعطي 7.","En":"−1/2 does not satisfy the equation; it gives seven."}},{"LatexCode":"\\{-3,\\frac12\\}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−3 يعطي 42، وليس صفراً.","En":"−3 gives 42, not zero."}},{"LatexCode":"\\{1,3\\}","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 يعطي −2، وليس صفراً.","En":"One gives −2, not zero."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما جذرا المعادلة 2x² − 7x + 3 = 0؟","En":"What are the roots of 2x² − 7x + 3 = 0?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستخدم القانون العام أو التحليل لإيجاد جذري المعادلة.","En":"Use the quadratic formula or factoring to find both roots."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نبحث عن عاملين حاصل ضربهما يساوي المقدار التربيعي.","En":"Seek two factors whose product matches the quadratic."},{"Ar":"التحليل $(2x-1)(x-3)=2x^2-7x+3$.","En":"Factor $(2x-1)(x-3)=2x^2-7x+3$."},{"Ar":"حاصل الضرب صفر إذا كان أحد العاملين صفراً، فنحصل على x=1/2 أو x=3.","En":"A product is zero if either factor is zero, giving x=1/2 or x=3."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\{3,\\frac12\\}$","En":"$\\{3,\\frac12\\}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس إشارات الجذور عند حل العوامل.","En":"Do not reverse root signs when solving the factors."},"FormulaLatex":"(2x-1)(x-3)=0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2x-1=0\\ \\lor\\ x-3=0$","En":"$2x-1=0\\ \\lor\\ x-3=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2(3)^2-7(3)+3=0,\\quad 2(1/2)^2-7(1/2)+3=0$","En":"$2(3)^2-7(3)+3=0,\\quad 2(1/2)^2-7(1/2)+3=0$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":41,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن تحليل يراعي معامل x² غير الواحد.","En":"Look for factors accounting for the non-unit leading coefficient."},{"Ar":"ساو كل عامل بالصفر، أو استخدم القانون العام.","En":"Set each factor to zero or use the quadratic formula."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستخدم القانون العام أو التحليل لإيجاد جذري المعادلة.","En":"Use the quadratic formula or factoring to find both roots."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نبحث عن عاملين حاصل ضربهما يساوي المقدار التربيعي.","En":"Seek two factors whose product matches the quadratic."},{"Ar":"التحليل $(2x-1)(x-3)=2x^2-7x+3$.","En":"Factor $(2x-1)(x-3)=2x^2-7x+3$."},{"Ar":"حاصل الضرب صفر إذا كان أحد العاملين صفراً، فنحصل على x=1/2 أو x=3.","En":"A product is zero if either factor is zero, giving x=1/2 or x=3."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\{3,\\frac12\\}$","En":"$\\{3,\\frac12\\}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس إشارات الجذور عند حل العوامل.","En":"Do not reverse root signs when solving the factors."},"FormulaLatex":"(2x-1)(x-3)=0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2x-1=0\\ \\lor\\ x-3=0$","En":"$2x-1=0\\ \\lor\\ x-3=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2(3)^2-7(3)+3=0,\\quad 2(1/2)^2-7(1/2)+3=0$","En":"$2(3)^2-7(3)+3=0,\\quad 2(1/2)^2-7(1/2)+3=0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1/2 لا يحقق المعادلة؛ يعطي 7.","En":"−1/2 does not satisfy the equation; it gives seven."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−3 يعطي 42، وليس صفراً.","En":"−3 gives 42, not zero."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 يعطي −2، وليس صفراً.","En":"One gives −2, not zero."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستخدم القانون العام أو التحليل لإيجاد جذري المعادلة.

$(2x-1)(x-3)=0$

1. نبحث عن عاملين حاصل ضربهما يساوي المقدار التربيعي.

2. التحليل $(2x-1)(x-3)=2x^2-7x+3$.

3. حاصل الضرب صفر إذا كان أحد العاملين صفراً، فنحصل على x=1/2 أو x=3.

$2x-1=0\ \lor\ x-3=0$

$\{3,\frac12\}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2(3)^2-7(3)+3=0,\quad 2(1/2)^2-7(1/2)+3=0$

لا تعكس إشارات الجذور عند حل العوامل.$mw$,$mw$Use the quadratic formula or factoring to find both roots.

$(2x-1)(x-3)=0$

1. Seek two factors whose product matches the quadratic.

2. Factor $(2x-1)(x-3)=2x^2-7x+3$.

3. A product is zero if either factor is zero, giving x=1/2 or x=3.

$2x-1=0\ \lor\ x-3=0$

$\{3,\frac12\}$ Dimensionless

$2(3)^2-7(3)+3=0,\quad 2(1/2)^2-7(1/2)+3=0$

Do not reverse root signs when solving the factors.$mw$),
(741,771,$mw$11002E3AF266F2746AFCF0389649259730F924787F9CCAD4C848FB141B4FA394$mw$,$mw$52d073c44f3fa4c5e97539393a5611d3$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":771,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"اختيار الجذر الموجب في مسألة مساحة مستطيل","TitleEn":"Select the physically meaningful root in an area model","QuestionTextAr":"مساحة مستطيل 48 سم² وطوله يزيد عن عرضه بمقدار 2 سم. كم عرضه بالسنتيمتر؟","QuestionTextEn":"A rectangle has area 48 cm² and its length is 2 cm more than its width. Find its width in centimeters.","DetailedSolutionAr":"ليكن العرض x والطول x+2. عندئذ x(x+2)=48 أي (x+8)(x−6)=0، فنرفض الجذر السالب −8 ونأخذ x=6.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Let width be x, length x+2. Then x(x+2)=48, so (x+8)(x−6)=0. Reject negative width −8; x=6.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":3073,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3074,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":3075,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":3076,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"عبّر عن الطول بدلالة العرض.","En":"Express length in terms of width."},{"Ar":"اكتب معادلة المساحة وحلها، واختر العرض الموجب.","En":"Write and solve the area equation, choosing the positive width."}],"Title":{"Ar":"اختيار الجذر الموجب في مسألة مساحة مستطيل","En":"Select the physically meaningful root in an area model"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4×6=24 سم² لا 48.","En":"4×6=24 cm², not 48."}},{"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":true,"ErrorType":"","Reason":null},{"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8×10=80 سم² لا 48.","En":"8×10=80 cm², not 48."}},{"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false,"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10×12=120 سم² لا 48.","En":"10×12=120 cm², not 48."}}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"مساحة مستطيل 48 سم² وطوله يزيد عن عرضه بمقدار 2 سم. كم عرضه بالسنتيمتر؟","En":"A rectangle has area 48 cm² and its length is 2 cm more than its width. Find its width in centimeters."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مساحة المستطيل حاصل ضرب الطول في العرض؛ الطول يزيد عن العرض بمقدار 2.","En":"Rectangle area is length times width; length is 2 more than width."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نسمي العرض x بالسنتيمتر، حيث x>0؛ الطول x+2.","En":"Let width be x cm, with x>0; length is x+2."},{"Ar":"معادلة المساحة $x(x+2)=48$، فتصبح $x^2+2x-48=0$.","En":"The area equation $x(x+2)=48$ becomes $x^2+2x-48=0$."},{"Ar":"نحلل $(x-6)(x+8)=0$؛ نقبل 6 ونرفض −8 لأن العرض موجب.","En":"Factor $(x-6)(x+8)=0$; accept six and reject −8 because width is positive."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقبل طولاً سالباً أو تخلط العرض بالطول.","En":"Do not accept a negative dimension or confuse width with length."},"FormulaLatex":"A=x(x+2)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+2x-48=(x-6)(x+8)=0$","En":"$x^2+2x-48=(x-6)(x+8)=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6(6+2)=48$","En":"$6(6+2)=48$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":41,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"عبّر عن الطول بدلالة العرض.","En":"Express length in terms of width."},{"Ar":"اكتب معادلة المساحة وحلها، واختر العرض الموجب.","En":"Write and solve the area equation, choosing the positive width."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مساحة المستطيل حاصل ضرب الطول في العرض؛ الطول يزيد عن العرض بمقدار 2.","En":"Rectangle area is length times width; length is 2 more than width."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نسمي العرض x بالسنتيمتر، حيث x>0؛ الطول x+2.","En":"Let width be x cm, with x>0; length is x+2."},{"Ar":"معادلة المساحة $x(x+2)=48$، فتصبح $x^2+2x-48=0$.","En":"The area equation $x(x+2)=48$ becomes $x^2+2x-48=0$."},{"Ar":"نحلل $(x-6)(x+8)=0$؛ نقبل 6 ونرفض −8 لأن العرض موجب.","En":"Factor $(x-6)(x+8)=0$; accept six and reject −8 because width is positive."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقبل طولاً سالباً أو تخلط العرض بالطول.","En":"Do not accept a negative dimension or confuse width with length."},"FormulaLatex":"A=x(x+2)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+2x-48=(x-6)(x+8)=0$","En":"$x^2+2x-48=(x-6)(x+8)=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6(6+2)=48$","En":"$6(6+2)=48$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4×6=24 سم² لا 48.","En":"4×6=24 cm², not 48."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8×10=80 سم² لا 48.","En":"8×10=80 cm², not 48."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10×12=120 سم² لا 48.","En":"10×12=120 cm², not 48."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مساحة المستطيل حاصل ضرب الطول في العرض؛ الطول يزيد عن العرض بمقدار 2.

$A=x(x+2)$

1. نسمي العرض x بالسنتيمتر، حيث x>0؛ الطول x+2.

2. معادلة المساحة $x(x+2)=48$، فتصبح $x^2+2x-48=0$.

3. نحلل $(x-6)(x+8)=0$؛ نقبل 6 ونرفض −8 لأن العرض موجب.

$x^2+2x-48=(x-6)(x+8)=0$

$6$ سم

$6(6+2)=48$

لا تقبل طولاً سالباً أو تخلط العرض بالطول.$mw$,$mw$Rectangle area is length times width; length is 2 more than width.

$A=x(x+2)$

1. Let width be x cm, with x>0; length is x+2.

2. The area equation $x(x+2)=48$ becomes $x^2+2x-48=0$.

3. Factor $(x-6)(x+8)=0$; accept six and reject −8 because width is positive.

$x^2+2x-48=(x-6)(x+8)=0$

$6$ cm

$6(6+2)=48$

Do not accept a negative dimension or confuse width with length.$mw$),
